# The editor gate the Caddyfile imports on the admin host. One user, `ose`,
# and the bcrypt hash of a long random password. The password itself is in
# the vault as "OSE automation — n8n editor gate" and nowhere else.
#
# To change it, generate a new password and its hash as "The editor password"
# in automation/infra/README.md describes, and replace the hash below in a pull
# request. The deploy restarts Caddy with it, and the old password stops
# working.
basic_auth {
	ose REPLACE_WITH_THE_BCRYPT_HASH
}
